    "detailed_description": "<strong>Sternly Worded Adventures</strong> is a roguelite word puzzle RPG inspired by <i>Bookworm Adventures</i> where you travel through a forested peninsula with Yorkshire-sounding place names fighting monsters with the power of words to uncover whatever dark secrets may be lurking beyond.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FEATURES</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Master over <strong>8 different classes</strong><br></li><li>Over <strong>15 different enemies</strong><br></li><li>Unlock over <strong>180 items</strong><br></li><li>Spell words with over <strong>25 different letters</strong></li></ul><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2562130/extras/0cdd39a90314e01fc349a7305730f5a9.avif?t=1730235638\" /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >WHAT'S IN THE DEMO?</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>In the demo you are limited to the starting <i>Adventurer</i> class.<br></li><li>You can play any adventure node up to and including Level 3. Visiting a Level 4 node triggers an event that ends the demo.<br></li><li>You have access to every item the adventurer could normally access except for one, which is restricted because it can trigger the afore mentioned event early.<br></li><li>You have full access both of the <i>Wordle</i> and <i>Minesweeper</i> inspired minigames, without limit.</li></ul><br><strong>You can directly continue your save file from the demo in the full version.</strong>",
